<title>USA: FGIC qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said it has qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Plymouth DT Library, Mich., $7.355 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Los Lunas School District No 1, N.M., $2.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Clark County, Nev., $97.91 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Southern Cayuga Central School District, N.Y., $4.21 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Sevier County, Tenn., $10 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Henderson, Texas, $8.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Ogden City, Utah, $23 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
